WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
A ball is thrown straight up.

2
00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:08.000
After t seconds, its height is
twenty t minus five t squared metres.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:12.330
High above the ground, a dashed
line marks twenty-five metres.

4
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.650
Does the ball ever reach that line?

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.380
And can you tell without solving anything?

6
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.830
Yes, at two point five seconds?

7
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:24.340
Or yes, twice, once going
up and once coming down?

8
00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.800
In this mission, you'll
complete the square,

9
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:30.850
which puts the greatest or least
value of a quadratic on show.

10
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.310
You'll also use the discriminant,
b squared minus four a c.

11
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.800
It tells you how many real
roots a quadratic equation has,

12
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.490
without finding them.

13
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.090
Your mission: decide whether the
ball ever reaches twenty-five metres.
